This report presents the initial observation of the $B^0_s\to\bar{D}^0 K^0_S$ decay mode and provides evidence for the $B^0_s\to\bar{D}^{*0} K^0_S$ process. The analysis is based on $3.0\,\text{fb}^{-1}$ of integrated luminosity from $pp$ collisions at $\gamma\gamma$ center-of-mass energies of 7 and 8 TeV, collected by the LHCb experiment. The measured branching fractions are given as
\begin{align*}
\mathcal{B}(B^0_s\to\bar{D}^{0} K^{\bar{S}}^{\text{'}} \bar{)} 
&=
(4.18 \pm 0.41 \pm 0.06) \times 10^{-4},
\end{align’'
